#: ../../upstream/docs/user/search-analytics.rst:2
msgid "Search analytics"
msgstr "搜索分析"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/search-analytics.rst:4
msgid ""
"When someone visits your documentation and uses the built-in :doc:`server "
"side search </server-side-search/index>` feature, Read the Docs will collect"
" analytics on their search queries."
msgstr ""
"当有人访问你的文档并使用内置的 :doc:`服务器端搜索 </server-side-search/index>` 功能时，Read the Docs "
"会收集其搜索查询的分析数据。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/search-analytics.rst:7
msgid ""
"These are aggregated into a simple view of the \"Top queries in the past 30 "
"days\". You can also download this data."
msgstr "这些数据被汇总为\"过去 30 天热门查询\"的简单视图。你也可以下载这些数据。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/search-analytics.rst:11
msgid ""
"This is helpful to optimize your documentation in alignment with your "
"readers' interests. You can discover new trends and expand your "
"documentation to new needs."
msgstr "这有助于根据读者兴趣优化文档。你可以发现新趋势，并将文档扩展到新的需求。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/search-analytics.rst:15
msgid "Using search analytics"
msgstr "使用搜索分析"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/search-analytics.rst:17
msgid ""
"To see a list of the top queries and an overview from the last month, go to "
"your project's :menuselection:`Settings --> Search analytics`."
msgstr "要查看过去一个月的热门查询列表和概览，前往项目的 :menuselection:`Settings --> Search analytics` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/search-analytics.rst:20
msgid "Search analytics demo"
msgstr "搜索分析演示"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/search-analytics.rst:25
msgid "How the search analytics page looks."
msgstr "搜索分析页面的样子。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/search-analytics.rst:27
msgid ""
"The list of top queries shows the latest searches ordered by their "
"popularity. Use the :guilabel:`Results` filter to show only queries with or "
"without results."
msgstr "热门查询列表按流行度展示最新搜索。使用 :guilabel:`Results` 过滤器可只显示有结果或无结果的查询。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/search-analytics.rst:31
msgid "Understanding your analytics"
msgstr "理解你的分析数据"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/search-analytics.rst:33
msgid ""
"In the list of top queries, you can see the most popular terms that users "
"have searched for. Next to the search query, the number of actual "
"**results** for that query is shown. The number of times the query has been "
"used in a search is displayed as the **queries** number."
msgstr "在热门查询列表中，你可以看到用户搜索最多的词。搜索查询旁边显示该查询的实际**结果** 数量。查询被搜索的次数显示为 **queries** 数量。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/search-analytics.rst:37
msgid ""
"If you see a search term that doesn't have any results, you could apply that"
" term in documentation articles or create new ones. This is a great way to "
"understand missing gaps in your documentation."
msgstr "若发现某个搜索词没有任何结果，可以在文档文章中应用该词或新建相关文章。这是了解文档内容缺口的好方法。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/search-analytics.rst:41
msgid ""
"If a search term is often used but the documentation article exists, it can "
"also indicate that it's hard to navigate to the article."
msgstr "若某个搜索词被频繁使用但相关文档文章确实存在，这也可能说明难以导航到该文章。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/search-analytics.rst:44
msgid ""
"Repeat the search yourself and inspect the results to see if they are "
"relevant. You can add keywords to various pages that you want to show up for"
" searches on that page."
msgstr "自己重复该搜索并检查结果是否相关。你可以给希望在该页搜索中出现的各个页面添加关键词。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/search-analytics.rst:47
msgid ""
"In **Overview**, you can see the daily search totals for the last month, and"
" trends that might match special events in your project's publicity. If you "
"wish to analyze these numbers in details, click :guilabel:`Download search "
"data` to get a CSV formatted file with all available search analytics."
msgstr ""
"在**概览** 中，你可以看到过去一个月的每日搜索总量，以及可能与项目推广特殊事件吻合的趋势。若想详细分析这些数字，点击 "
":guilabel:`Download search data` 获取包含全部可用搜索分析数据的 CSV 文件。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/search-analytics.rst:53
msgid "Data storage"
msgstr "数据存储"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/search-analytics.rst:55
msgid "The duration of analytics data stored depends on which site you're using:"
msgstr "分析数据的存储时长取决于你使用的站点："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/search-analytics.rst:57
msgid "On |org_brand|, the last 90 days are stored."
msgstr "|org_brand| 存储最近 90 天。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/search-analytics.rst:58
msgid ""
"On |com_brand|, storage duration starts at 30 days and increases with plan "
"level."
msgstr "|com_brand| 存储时长从 30 天起，随套餐等级提升。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/search-analytics.rst:62
msgid "`Our plan pricing <https://about.readthedocs.com/pricing/>`_"
msgstr "`Our plan pricing <https://about.readthedocs.com/pricing/>`_"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/search-analytics.rst:63
msgid "Compare our plan pricing and analytics storage duration."
msgstr "比较我们的套餐定价与分析数据存储时长。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/search-analytics.rst:65
msgid ":doc:`/traffic-analytics`"
msgstr ":doc:`/traffic-analytics`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/search-analytics.rst:66
msgid "See how users are using your documentation."
msgstr "了解用户如何使用你的文档。"

